== contraintes audit.events et auth.user_permissions
          rel          |            conname             | contype |                                                                                                                                                                               def                                                                                                                                                                                
-----------------------+--------------------------------+---------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 auth.user_permissions | ck_user_permissions_permission | c       | CHECK (((permission)::text = ANY ((ARRAY['system.admin'::character varying, 'clients.read'::character varying, 'clients.write'::character varying, 'clients.archive'::character varying, 'appointments.read'::character varying, 'appointments.write'::character varying, 'appointments.cancel'::character varying, 'audit.read'::character varying])::text[])))
 auth.user_permissions | fk_user_permissions_users      | f       | FOREIGN KEY (user_id) REFERENCES auth.users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE
 auth.user_permissions | pk_user_permissions            | p       | PRIMARY KEY (user_id, permission)
 audit.events          | ck_events_action_format        | c       | CHECK (((action)::text ~ '^[a-z][a-z_]{0,30}\.[a-z][a-z_]{0,31}$'::text))
 audit.events          | ck_events_changes_array        | c       | CHECK (((changes IS NULL) OR (jsonb_typeof(changes) = 'array'::text)))
 audit.events          | ck_events_entity_type_format   | c       | CHECK (((entity_type)::text ~ '^[a-z][a-z_]{0,31}$'::text))
 audit.events          | ck_events_module_format        | c       | CHECK (((module)::text ~ '^[a-z][a-z_]{0,31}$'::text))
 audit.events          | fk_events_actor_users          | f       | FOREIGN KEY (actor_user_id) REFERENCES auth.users(id) ON DELETE RESTRICT
 audit.events          | fk_events_clients              | f       | FOREIGN KEY (client_id) REFERENCES clients.clients(id) ON DELETE RESTRICT
 audit.events          | pk_events                      | p       | PRIMARY KEY (id)
(10 rows)

== index audit
         indexname         |                                                   indexdef                                                    
---------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 ix_events_actor_user_id   | CREATE INDEX ix_events_actor_user_id ON audit.events USING btree (actor_user_id)
 ix_events_client_occurred | CREATE INDEX ix_events_client_occurred ON audit.events USING btree (client_id, occurred_at_utc DESC, id DESC)
 ix_events_entity          | CREATE INDEX ix_events_entity ON audit.events USING btree (entity_type, entity_id)
 pk_events                 | CREATE UNIQUE INDEX pk_events ON audit.events USING btree (id)
(4 rows)

